sequenceDiagram
    participant Corpus as Image corpus
    participant Doc as encode_document
    participant User as User query
    participant Q as encode_query
    participant Sim as similarity

    Note over Corpus,Doc: Offline - once per image
    Corpus->>Doc: car.jpg, bee.jpg
    Doc->>Sim: doc vectors

    Note over User,Q: Online - each search
    User->>Q: vehicle near building
    Q->>Sim: query vector
    Sim->>User: car scores higher - retrieve car